  "body": "A fresh start. A stunning transformation. A lifestyle to love.\r\n\r\nHaving undergone the ultimate makeover, 37 Vista Motu now presents like a brand-new home, combining contemporary style, quality finishes and easy-care coastal living in one beautifully packaged property.\r\n\r\nReimagined by highly regarded Zebuild, this impressive transformation delivers the best of modern living, with new cladding and double-glazed joinery complemented by a designer kitchen and beautifully appointed bathrooms. Every detail has been thoughtfully considered to create a home that feels fresh, stylish and ready to enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nPositioned to capture all-day sun, the home offers generous decking and beautifully landscaped outdoor spaces, perfect for entertaining friends, relaxing with family or simply soaking up the coastal atmosphere. Upstairs, sea views provide an added reminder of the lifestyle on offer, while excellent off-street parking and large internal-access garaging ensure everyday practicality is every bit as impressive as the presentation.\r\n\r\nThe setting is equally appealing. Tucked away down a right of way at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, this is a street well known across the Hibiscus Coast for its spectacular annual Christmas lights display. Better still, Red Beach is within easy walking distance via the public walkway to Esther Place, making those spontaneous beach visits all the more tempting.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold site, this is a compelling opportunity to secure a beautifully transformed home where the hard work has been done and the lifestyle is ready to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\nModern, low-maintenance living, a coastal setting and a makeover that truly delivers — all within an affordable price bracket.\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been searching for a home that ticks all the boxes without the premium price tag, 37 Vista Motu deserves your attention.",
